  "probe10Note": "19/10/2026 (dot 3, preview probe v10 on the published 1.0.18, Moxie + Figma, light + dark, 33 pages: 8 rules failing -> 0). The style guide page (/typography/, .t4-typo-example) kept Bootstrap's literal fills, alerts, badges, cards and outline buttons: each now takes the system's role, paired as the Joomla twin's shared Bootstrap block pairs them (primary accent/accent-on, secondary and light the surface, status fills the status text shade under the page colour, alerts the status tint, dark the ink), and .btn the system's corner (TPL-1, BTN-1, CON-2, border-colour). Category dots (--je-cat, --je-cat-page and the tag dots' literal hues), the header social marks and the sidebar numbers kept the template's teal/purple/orange/blue: the dots and marks take their link's words colour (as the Joomla twin's carousel chips), the numbers the readable accent (ACCENT-LEAK, TPL-1 pseudo-colour). The media badges (.je-media-icon, #4d6bff in the release css) and the article pull quote (--accent as words, 2.87:1 on Moxie light) read accent-text; the submenu's current item (a literal !important light-dark #1a3eed/#7d93ff) reads accent-text-hover; the account links' hover accent-text-hover (HOVER-1). Account, contact, tag filter and newsletter fields wear the page ground with the system's border (FORM-1), their focus line the accent; the account and contact form buttons the system's button corner, the Cancel button the danger text shade under the page colour, the password eye a muted fill (Joomla twin). The dark highlight cards (category styles 2-4, Home 4: #1c1c1c) are the ink (GROUND-1); Home 2 and Home 5 paint their light page white: the system's page (GROUND-2 footer). Forced-hover sweep (accent-leak.mjs --hover, Moxie, Figma, Mailchimp, Dribbble, light + dark): the share and author social buttons (brand fills) and the pager hover (white words on Mailchimp's yellow) now wear the accent pair; 0 LEAK after."
